<title>USA: MaxServ to build new headquarters.</title>
<headline>MaxServ to build new headquarters.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>MaxServ Inc said it plans to build a new headquarters and operations center in Round Rock, Texas, located in the northeast sector of the greater Austin area.</p>
<p>Occupancy of the new facility is scheduled for mid 1998.</p>
</text>
